abstract: >-
  R code for processing NHANES 2011–2014 PAX80 raw wrist accelerometry with
  GGIR 3.0.0 and deriving an individualised sleep-anchored MVPA timing
  phenotype using a 1,440-min habitual MVPA distribution, circular centroid,
  resultant vector length, habitual sleep midpoint, and modulo-24 phase angle.
